{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"46fab598a645e0c5","type":"text","text":"教学目标","x":-320,"y":-280,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"ff8137c0338a570c","type":"text","text":"教学流程","x":-322,"y":-107,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"8144bd38ba1e3578","type":"text","text":"基础PPT文稿","x":-322,"y":51,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"42471c00823b844f","type":"text","text":" **总体目标**\n\n\n","x":372,"y":-599,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"dfed1cf0d1e74c96","type":"text","text":"- 利用 AI 助教在智能出题和智能批改领域的创新应用，提高学生的自主学习能力和教师的教学效率。","x":752,"y":-707,"width":788,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"e2b39e5b7e3bca5e","type":"text","text":"    \n- 结合 AI 伙伴模型，引导学生通过逻辑推理和自我讲解的方式加深对知识点的掌握，形成以“学会”为核心的学习模式。","x":738,"y":-501,"width":882,"height":81},
		{"id":"54c4d6704636e62c","type":"text","text":"**具体目标**","x":372,"y":-360,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"46349579a1a94dd2","type":"text","text":"**AI 伙伴模型**\n","x":740,"y":-244,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"5f8c5c70e869f6bb","type":"text","text":"**智能批改**","x":733,"y":-411,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"99dfc21a8d655324","type":"text","text":"**智能出题**","x":736,"y":-323,"width":250,"height":62,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"04d9228d819389fc","type":"text","text":"- 通过 AI 识别学生的解题过程，提供逻辑链分析和个性化解题反馈。\n    \n- 结合 deepseek 深度思考模型，实现思维路径优化，提高解题效率。","x":1104,"y":-410,"width":576,"height":87,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"57318967ef2dc745","type":"text","text":"- 基于知识图谱构建个性化学习路径，动态调整出题策略。\n- 结合费曼学习法，引导学生通过讲解来巩固知识，实现知识迁移。","x":1104,"y":-297,"width":578,"height":72,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"5c9847c5dd19b71a","type":"text","text":"\n- 通过 AI 互动对话，推动“提问-反馈-再提问”循环，帮助学生掌握知识点。\n    \n- 促进学生逻辑思维训练，使其能够主动思考问题并构建完整的知识体系。","x":1104,"y":-202,"width":578,"height":60},
		{"id":"5891fea8d9864486","type":"text","text":"教师：","x":761,"y":-109,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"048034bfe3425583","type":"text","text":"学生：","x":762,"y":-13,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"5c3a709326a6fa92","type":"text","text":"**1. 课前准备**    ","x":300,"y":-47,"width":250,"height":67,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ea2841c63fc3e379","type":"text","text":"**2. 课堂教学**","x":301,"y":124,"width":249,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"b2ffbf79a312cc9d","type":"text","text":"**(2) 互动实验**","x":771,"y":242,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c2b5f489ba5372a8","type":"text","text":"2. **智能出题演示**","x":1155,"y":480,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"03e4d707cc803c37","type":"text","text":"1. **智能批改演示**","x":1155,"y":320,"width":250,"height":61,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"e475857f48490888","type":"text","text":"学生提交数学题目解答，AI 进行逻辑链分析并提供批改反馈。\n","x":1522,"y":246,"width":318,"height":60},
		{"id":"44600f99bc112f88","type":"text","text":"结合最优解法，AI 生成知识点拓展建议，引导学生复盘。","x":1521,"y":358,"width":319,"height":60},
		{"id":"3b7babca3bf2417d","type":"text","text":"AI 根据学生的掌握情况动态生成个性化题目。\n","x":1516,"y":437,"width":324,"height":60},
		{"id":"0214063104a26ae7","type":"text","text":"学生通过 AI 伙伴模型回答问题，系统检测掌握程度。","x":1519,"y":552,"width":321,"height":60},
		{"id":"c503b1fe0fdffe71","type":"text","text":"3. **费曼学习法应用**","x":1155,"y":656,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"8a2f1947763d5bb7","type":"text","text":"\n  \n        \nAI 伙伴不断提问，确保学生完全理解相关知识点。\n","x":1519,"y":717,"width":321,"height":60},
		{"id":"35e5c877eaeb6626","type":"text","text":"学生对 AI 伙伴模型进行讲解，模拟教学过程。","x":1522,"y":631,"width":322,"height":55},
		{"id":"fa7f70092a726390","type":"text","text":"**3. 课后巩固**","x":300,"y":351,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"1749cc6717a4e6b5","type":"text","text":"**教师**：","x":764,"y":906,"width":125,"height":50},
		{"id":"1d6eae69a9f68504","type":"text","text":"**学生**：","x":764,"y":760,"width":125,"height":61},
		{"id":"9c5c643cb41ae916","type":"text","text":"查看 AI 生成的学习报告，调整后续教学策略。","x":1135,"y":914,"width":305,"height":60},
		{"id":"6ed972d01f33bc20","type":"text","text":"继续使用 AI 助教进行自主学习，完成知识点的进一步深化。\n    ","x":1135,"y":791,"width":305,"height":60},
		{"id":"4f27b19e602dde48","type":"text","text":"预加载 AI 助教的出题与批改逻辑，确保实验的可执行性。","x":1104,"y":-72,"width":574,"height":60},
		{"id":"49a57aac78ddd4d5","type":"text","text":"设定知识点范围，整理教材、讲义、例题和题库。\n","x":1104,"y":-139,"width":574,"height":60},
		{"id":"69b9fbcc2ddcdbaf","type":"text","text":"**(1) 理论讲解**\n","x":762,"y":107,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"cc725bf59d75c3c5","type":"text","text":"- 讲解 **知识图谱** 与 **费曼学习法** 在 AI 伴学中的重要作用。","x":1153,"y":167,"width":525,"height":60},
		{"id":"041cda14251acb2a","type":"text","text":"\n- 介绍 **智能批改与智能出题** 的工作原理，强调 AI 在教学中的应用价值。\n    ","x":1153,"y":107,"width":525,"height":60},
		{"id":"17c3fe6a934baec1","type":"text","text":"了解 AI 助教的基本功能，提前完成自主学习任务。","x":1104,"y":17,"width":578,"height":60},
		{"id":"690178cd172fb2bb","type":"file","file":"011_项目经验/计设赛/基础演示 PPT 文稿.md","x":-861,"y":272,"width":539,"height":927}
	],
